exports[`spot release email > released report 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html lang="en"><body style="margin:0;background:#faf7f2;font-family:sans-serif"><div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px;color:#334155"><h1 style="font-size:20px;color:#1e293b;margin:0 0 12px">Your screening is ready</h1><p style="margin:0 0 20px">Thanks for using Spot. Your accessibility screening report is ready.</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px"><a href="https://ada.adalegallink.com/spot/r/abc123xyz" style="display:inline-block;background:#8a2c08;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;line-height:20px;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:6px">View your screening report</a></p><p style="margin:0 0 16px">A person read this report before it was sent.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;color:#3f4b5b">This report is an automated screening based on the photos you provided — a starting point for planning remediation, not a professional inspection or a legal determination. Findings should be confirmed on-site.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#3f4b5b">The link above doesn’t expire. Your uploaded photos are deleted after 90 days, and come out of the report when they go — the findings stay.</p></div></body></html>",
  "subject": "Your accessibility screening from Spot is ready",
  "text": "Your screening is ready

Thanks for using Spot. Your accessibility screening report is ready.

View your screening report: https://ada.adalegallink.com/spot/r/abc123xyz

A person read this report before it was sent.

This report is an automated screening based on the photos you provided — a starting point for planning remediation, not a professional inspection or a legal determination. Findings should be confirmed on-site.

The link above doesn’t expire. Your uploaded photos are deleted after 90 days, and come out of the report when they go — the findings stay.",
}
`;
